This creates a new column, computed from an existing one \'97 very common for derived/calculated fields.\
Exactly right \'97 that line only modifies the DataFrame 
\f1\b in memory
\f0\b0  (inside your running Python program). It has zero effect on the actual CSV file sitting on your disk unless you explicitly tell pandas to write it back out.\

\f1\b The mental model
\f0\b0 \
Think of it like this:\
