\f0\b0  \'97 is the skeleton of virtually every classical ML workflow you'll encounter, whether in an interview take-home, a real project, or reading someone else's code. Once this shape is familiar, swapping in different datasets or different algorithms (not just LogisticRegression) becomes mostly a matter of changing a couple of lines, not relearning the whole process.\
